      "id": "claim_153af9e43ba54ad0bf582e539c683ffc",
      "statement": "The TweetSmash bookmarks feature is a native REST integration in src/bookmarks.ts: it calls GET https://api.tweetsmash.com/v1/bookmarks with Bearer auth, sending both q and vector_search_term (keyword + semantic) set to the user's prompt, with a 12-second AbortController timeout and User-Agent grok-cli/0.1; no ft, MCP, or Python is involved.",
